      "text": "The creature kicks sand into an adjacent creature's face. That creature makes a DC 19 basic Reflex save. On a failure, that creature is Dazzled and treated as Off-Guard to this creature's next attack; a success negates the off-guard effects.\n\nNote: A DC was not provided for this ability by Paizo. The DC present here is a moderate DC for the creature level according to the Gamemastery Guide creature building Tables."
